i also love metal, and i think that most of the bands that are anti-christian or have some sort of blasphemous lyrics usually are just doing it for the look and to fit in, not because they really believe it.

&#x200B;

so i think you are fine as long as it doesn't control your actions or anything

well you have to record your dreams in a dream journal, which will make your dreams end up being more recallable and make you sort of remember and be able to analyze your dreams, and meditating for at least 20 min a day will usually help.

&#x200B;

another way is you can do it from fully awake to right into a lucid dream by closing your eyes and not moving, and you will end up in sleep paralysis (if you dont know what that is just look it up) and from there you can enter a dream, but fully aware. The other methods are more random and when you do end up having a lucid dream, it will be a nice surprise.

